### Avro Generated ###
**/src/main/avro-generated/

# Hand-written Avro schemas are the Kafka wire contract and must be versioned.
# They live in oms-contracts and nowhere else; the rule below catches stray copies
# reappearing in a service module.
**/src/main/avro/
!oms-contracts/src/main/avro/

